{"title":"Special Civil Servant","synopsis":"Setelah empat kali gagal dalam ujian pegawai negeri sipil Kelas Sembilan dan melalui banyak liku-liku, Han Maru akhirnya berhasil menjadi pegawai negeri sipil khusus di bawah Kementerian Lingkungan Hidup. Selamat tinggal, gosiwon! Selamat tinggal, kotak makan siang toko serba ada! Namun kegembiraan saat melewatinya hanya berumur pendek. Ternyata itu adalah pekerjaan rahasia nasional yang mengancam jiwa?! Bersamaan dengan debu kuning datanglah iblis, makhluk yang membunuh dan memakan manusia. Pekerjaan pegawai negeri khusus Kelas 9 melibatkan peperangan melawan iblis-iblis ini! Karir pegawai negeri sipil yang mengancam jiwa Han Maru dimulai.","alternative_title":"Extraordinary Civil Servant ข้าราชการพิเศษ 特殊公務員は今日も命がけです 特聘公務員 별정직 공무원","author":"Kwon Sora, Seo Jaewon","artist":"Baesaem, Chamuring","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"053602cf-2c8b-425f-b23c-53bdd03ffe73","number":"68","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"6030faec-a402-456a-87c4-205fe53169d0","number":"67","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id":"c063aafd-48f5-4f29-9f87-9ba916b89d8d","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-04-17","images":[]},{"id":"b2cf083e-15c8-425b-9af2-de71f470e778","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-04-05","images":[]},{"id":"0b97df4b-01c6-47f6-a671-c46842aca158","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-03-27","images":[]},{"id":"c1f56c83-07f6-4814-98eb-ecb4db226ea2","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-03-26","images":[]},{"id":"88460677-bf4c-47b0-9003-c97e83b651fc","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-03-20","images":[]},{"id":"10033ad2-9468-4982-8024-f19b86ee6a71","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-03-12","images":[]},{"id":"91825ecb-94b9-4b73-9caa-4378027b9d27","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-03-04","images":[]},{"id":"a3af2dc6-e563-4e30-892d-8a746674b2a8","number":"59","title":"Chap